1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,166
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03,216 --> 00:00:05,907
Robotics 101, video 2.

3
00:00:05,957 --> 00:00:10,890
Understanding robots: sense, think, act.

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:17,394
A fan spins and a toaster gets hot, but they are not robots.

5
00:00:17,444 --> 00:00:20,271
So what makes a machine a robot?

6
00:00:20,321 --> 00:00:21,710
Let us find out.

7
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:25,638
Every robot does three things.

8
00:00:25,688 --> 00:00:30,650
First it senses: it collects information about the world.

9
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:35,223
Then it thinks: a small computer decides what to do.

10
00:00:35,273 --> 00:00:39,532
Then it acts: it moves or makes something happen.

11
00:00:39,582 --> 00:00:42,170
And then it does it all again.

12
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,046
You do this every day.

13
00:00:45,096 --> 00:00:49,051
When a friend throws you a ball, your eyes sense it, your

14
00:00:49,101 --> 00:00:53,268
brain thinks about where it will land, and your hands act to

15
00:00:53,318 --> 00:00:53,900
catch it.

16
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:58,375
Our line-follower works the same way.

17
00:00:58,425 --> 00:01:01,551
Its infrared sensors sense the floor.

18
00:01:01,601 --> 00:01:05,756
The Arduino board thinks and chooses a direction.

19
00:01:05,806 --> 00:01:08,760
The motors act and turn the wheels.

20
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:15,521
The robot repeats this loop very fast, hundreds of times every second.

21
00:01:15,571 --> 00:01:19,470
That is why it can react the moment the line bends.

22
00:01:20,850 --> 00:01:21,569
Try this.

23
00:01:21,619 --> 00:01:28,150
An automatic door senses you, decides, and opens, so it behaves like a robot.

24
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:34,730
A remote-control car is different, because a person does the thinking for it.

25
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,571
Let us recap.

26
00:01:37,621 --> 00:01:40,632
Robots sense, think and act.

27
00:01:40,682 --> 00:01:44,785
Then they repeat, many times a second.

28
00:01:44,835 --> 00:01:49,048
Our robot: IR sensors, Arduino, motors.

29
00:01:49,098 --> 00:01:53,530
Next: Exploring the hardware in your kit.
